        { "rareAlert", false, "A warning when a rare is near you: when its nameplate comes up, you mouse over it or target it. A card with its portrait: right-click it to close it, and its pin sets a waypoint to the rare. Move it in the HUD Editor.", "Rare Alerts", false },
