        { "bar", false, "For paladins, a button per class in your group. Left-click blesses the next member of that class who needs it, missing first, skipping anyone dead or out of range. Right-click a class to choose its blessing or open its player list. Move it in the HUD Editor. The preview edits it: right-click a class for its blessing, click the aura to choose it, wheel for size and Shift-wheel for spacing, drag the gap after the aura, x hides a button and + brings it back.", "Blessing Bar", false },
